; ======================================================================================
; TI-SLOT-THROUGHTOOL  OP10        open slot 26.0 +0.05/0 x 8.0 deep in Ti-6Al-4V plate
; PART      : plate 100 x 70 x 30 (Ti-6Al-4V grade 5, annealed), slot along X through the part
; MACHINE   : DMG MORI DMU 50 3rd gen, SINUMERIK 840D sl, SK40, ICS through-spindle coolant 40 bar
; SETUP     : LANG Makro-Grip 77 (48085-46) on Quick-Point 52 plate 45600, grip 4 mm (stamped),
;             jaws on the 70 mm faces; B0 C0 (3-axis job on the 5-axis machine)
; ZERO G54  : X0 Y0 = centre of the plate top, Z0 = top face; slot centreline on Y0
; TOOLS
;   T1 D1   TUNGALOY TUNGFORCE-REC EPAV12M025C25.0R04 + 4 X AVMT120408PDER-MM AH3225
;           D25 Z4 RE0.8 APMX11.5, THROUGH-COOLANT BODY
;           HAIMER POWER SHRINK SK40 40.445.25.3, STICKOUT 60, L1=135.000 R=12.500
; CUTTING DATA  Tungaloy 506-G p. 25, ISO S, AH3225: vc 20-60 m/min, fz 0.04-0.15 mm
;   SLOTTING  vc 45 m/min  S573  fz 0.08  F183  ae 25 (full width)  ap 3.9 + 3.9
;   FINISH    vc 55 m/min  S700  fz 0.12  F336  ae 0.512 per wall (climb), floor 0.2
; The model (part.step) is drawn at 26.025 = middle of the width tolerance; the program
; is the tool-centre path for R12.500 (no radius compensation).
; ======================================================================================
N10 G17 G40 G71 G90 G94
N20 G54
N30 CYCLE832()
N40 T1                                  ; D25 TUNGFORCE-REC, 4 INSERTS, ICS
N50 M6
N60 D1
N70 CYCLE832(0.05,_ROUGH,1)
N80 S573 M3
N90 G0 X-66.000 Y0.000
N100 G0 Z50.000
N110 M7                                 ; ICS through-spindle coolant 40 bar on
N120 G4 F2                              ; let the pressure build up
N130 G0 Z2.000
; ---- slotting, full width, two passes of ap 3.9 (floor left at Z-7.8)
N140 G1 Z-3.900 F2000                   ; beside the part (cutter edge 3.5 mm off the end face)
N150 G1 X66.000 F183                    ; pass 1, +X
N160 G1 Z-7.800 F2000                   ; beside the part at X+66
N170 G1 X-66.000 F183                   ; pass 2, -X
; ---- finishing pass: wall A (Y-13.012) then wall B (Y+13.012), both climb, floor to Z-8.0
N180 CYCLE832(0.005,_FINISH,1)
N190 S700
N200 G1 Y-0.512 F2000                   ; beside the part at X-66
N210 G1 Z-8.000 F2000
N220 G1 X66.000 F336                    ; wall A, climb (material on the right)
N230 G1 Y0.512 F2000                    ; beside the part at X+66
N240 G1 X-66.000 F336                   ; wall B, climb
N250 G0 Z50.000
N260 M9
N270 M5
N280 CYCLE832()
N290 G0 G153 Z0 D0                      ; machine Z0 without tool length
N300 M30
